# Allowlist: this repo is public, but the folder also holds private working state.
# Everything is ignored unless named below, so a new file stays local until it is
# added here on purpose. Check `git status --ignored` before a big commit.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/CLAUDE.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/.github/
!/PLAYBOOK.md
!/LESSONS.md
!/skill/
!/templates/

# Never public, even if someone widens the list above:
#   HUB.md RULES.md INDEX.md   local orientation, standing rules, do-not-re-raise
#   projects/<name>/           per-project state and session notes (code lives at ~/<name>)
#   sessions/                  dated logs of whole working sessions
# Personal skill settings live outside the repo in ~/.config/oss-contribute/.
